    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the windshield assembly, its retaining bracket, the outboard doubler and the fastener set, with the pre and post modification bracket that follows the heater terminal position.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "To identify the windshield assembly, its retaining bracket, the outboard doubler and the fastener set at the flight compartment aperture.",
      "figure_note": "The figure is drawn from outside the aircraft looking aft at the left-hand aperture; the right-hand installation is a mirror image and is not separately illustrated. Item 20 and item 20A are the retaining bracket at the relocated and the original heater terminal positions; they are not interchangeable and the bracket must match the pane fitted. The doubler at item 30 is re-drilled at installation and is listed as a common item across both standards. The shim pack is not illustrated because it is built to the measured value at each position."
    },
